      "title": "Model Download Links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Important!\n### You need to update the Mickmumpitznodes at least to version 1.5.6!\n\n---\n\n## Required Models\n\n| Model file | 📁 Model folder under *ComfyUI/models* | Download Link |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| **model.safetensors** (4DAnyone) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/model.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/model.safetensors) |\n| **Wan2.2_VAE.pth** | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan2.2_VAE.pth](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan2.2_VAE.pth) |\n| **prompt_context.safetensors** | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/prompt_context.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/prompt_context.safetensors) |\n| **Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors** (only with Turbo enabled) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors) |\n| **imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors** (VGG-19 perceptual, only for Train Sequence) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/resolve/main/perceptual/imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/resolve/main/perceptual/imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors) |\n| **model.safetensors** (BiRefNet) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/model.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/model.safetensors) |\n| **config.json** (BiRefNet — must sit alongside model) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/config.json](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/config.json) |\n| **birefnet.py** (BiRefNet — must sit alongside model) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/birefnet.py](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/birefnet.py) |\n| **BiRefNet_config.py** (BiRefNet — must sit alongside model) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/BiRefNet_config.py](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/BiRefNet_config.py) |\n| **sam_3d_body_dinov3_bf16.safetensors** (SAM 3D Body) | /detection | [https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam-3d-body/resolve/main/detection/sam_3d_body_dinov3_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam-3d-body/resolve/main/detection/sam_3d_body_dinov3_bf16.safetensors) |\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Important!\n### You need to update the Mickmumpitznodes at least to version 1.5.6!\n\n---\n\n## Required Models\n\n| Model file | 📁 Model folder under *ComfyUI/models* | Download Link |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| **model.safetensors** (4DAnyone) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/model.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/model.safetensors) |\n| **Wan2.2_VAE.pth** | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan2.2_VAE.pth](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan2.2_VAE.pth) |\n| **prompt_context.safetensors** | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/prompt_context.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/prompt_context.safetensors) |\n| **Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors** (only with Turbo enabled) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/blob/main/4danyone/Wan22_TI2V_5B_Turbo_lora_rank_64_fp16.safetensors) |\n| **imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors** (VGG-19 perceptual, only for Train Sequence) | /splatkit/4danyone | [https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/resolve/main/perceptual/imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/AntResearch/4DAnyone/resolve/main/perceptual/imagenet-vgg-verydeep-19-conv.safetensors) |\n| **model.safetensors** (BiRefNet) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/model.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/model.safetensors) |\n| **config.json** (BiRefNet — must sit alongside model) | /splatkit/birefnet | [https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/config.json](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet/blob/main/config